!!! archon/engine/rules.mat
!!! Applying a knowledge rule to a scanned line.
!!!
!!! The first analyzer is literal pattern matching. A rule matches a line when
!!! the line contains the rule's needle; matching produces a finding that
!!! inherits the rule's severity, confidence and category.

book archon.engine.rules

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from archon.model.severity
read everything from archon.model.confidence
read everything from archon.model.category
read everything from archon.model.location
read everything from archon.model.finding
read everything from archon.model.rule
read everything from archon.engine.patterns

!!! True when the rule's needle appears in the line.
public rule-matches receives rule as knowledge-rule, line as text returns boolean begin paragraph
    give line-contains with line being line, needle being rule.needle
end paragraph

!!! Build the finding a matched rule produces at a given location.
public finding-from-rule receives rule as knowledge-rule, place as location, identity-value as number returns finding begin paragraph
    give build finding with identity being identity-value, rule-id being rule.identity, title being rule.title, detail being "matched rule " plus rule.identity, level being rule.level, certainty being rule.certainty, domain being rule.domain, place being place, guidance being rule.guidance
end paragraph
